ABILITY:Rogue Talent|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Rogue Talent ~ Camouflage|TYPE:RogueTalent.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary|DESC:Once per day, a rogue with this talent can craft simple but effective camouflage from the surrounding foliage. The rogue needs 1 minute to prepare the camouflage, but once she does, it is good for the rest of the day or until the rogue fails a saving throw against an area effect spell that deals fire, cold, or acid damage, whichever comes first. The rogue gains a +4 bonus on Stealth checks while within terrain that matches the foliage used to make the camouflage. This ability cannot be used in areas without natural foliage.
ABILITY:Rogue Talent|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Rogue Talent ~ Canny Observer|TYPE:RogueTalent.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Unchained Rogue Talent|DESC:When a rogue with this talent makes a Perception check to hear the details of a conversation or to find concealed or secret objects (including doors and traps), she gains a +4 bonus.
ABILITY:Rogue Talent|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Rogue Talent ~ Climbing Stunt|TYPE:Rogue Class Feature.SpecialQuality.RogueTalent.Extraordinary|DESC:A rogue with this talent can take a -10 penalty on a Climb check to move at full speed while climbing. A rogue must be trained in Climb to select this talent.
ABILITY:Rogue Talent|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Rogue Talent ~ Combat Trick|APPLIEDTO:|TYPE:RogueClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.RogueTalent|DESC:You gain a bonus combat feat.
